# Business Recommendations

### 1. Improve Retention for High-Churn Plans
Launch targeted retention campaigns for Standard and Basic plan customers through personalized offers, feature upgrades, and renewal incentives.

### 2. Increase Customer Engagement
Identify customers with low engagement and implement product adoption programs, in-app guidance, and personalized email campaigns.

### 3. Strengthen Customer Support
Reduce response times and improve first-contact resolution for customers reporting poor support experiences.

### 4. Develop Industry-Specific Retention Strategies
Conduct detailed analysis for high-churn industries and tailor onboarding, support, and product offerings to their specific business needs.

### 5. Protect High-Value Customers
Assign dedicated account managers to customers classified as **Immediate Outreach** and conduct proactive retention reviews before renewal.

### 6. Address the Primary Churn Drivers
Reduce churn caused by low product usage through user training, review pricing strategies for cost-sensitive customers, and improve support quality to address service-related churn.
